#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Time-evolution circuits {#time-evolution-circuits}"
msgstr "Sirkuit time-evolution {#time-evolution-circuits}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"These circuits simulate a quantum state evolving in time. Use time-evolution"
" circuits to investigate physical effects such as heat transfer or phase "
"transitions in a system. Time-evolution circuits are also a fundamental "
"building block of chemistry wave functions (such as unitary coupled-cluster "
"trial states) and of the QAOA algorithm we use for optimization problems.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sirkuit-sirkuit ini mensimulasikan evolusi state kuantum dalam waktu. "
"Gunakan sirkuit time-evolution untuk menyelidiki efek fisika seperti "
"perpindahan panas atau transisi fase dalam suatu sistem. Sirkuit time-"
"evolution juga merupakan blok pembangun fundamental dari fungsi gelombang "
"kimia (seperti state percobaan unitary coupled-cluster) dan dari algoritma "
"QAOA yang kita gunakan untuk masalah optimasi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
